    "object": {
      "Graph": {
        "@Type": "f8a58466",
        "@Value": {
          "Implementation": {
            "@Type": "3b83b776",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)rplacd(cell, list);\nlist := cell;\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)4ca81d4e-3210-431f-87ae-e32c55f26799_Impl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "Interface": {
            "@Type": "a9ed5b7e",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)(*\n================================================================================\nFunction Block Method : ConsHeap.cons\n\nPurpose:\n    Prepends an existing cons cell to a list.\n\nApplication:\n    Call to add an allocated cell to the head of a list.\n\nOperation:\n    1. Sets the cell's cdr to the current list head.\n    2. Updates the list head to the cell register.\n\nInputs:\n    cell - Register of the cell to prepend.\n\nOutputs:\n    None.\n\nInOut:\n    list - List head; updated to the new head.\n\nReturn Value:\n    None.\n\nAssumptions:\n    - cell is a valid heap register.\n\nLimitations:\n    - Does not check whether cell is already linked into another list.\n\nDependencies:\n    - ConsHeap.rplacd.\n\nExample:\n\n    fbConsHeap.cons(list := crList, cell := crCell);\n\nRevision History:\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Date         Version  Author           Description\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    13/11/2026   1.0      CannyIEC         Documented existing behaviour\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n================================================================================\n*)\nMETHOD cons\nVAR_IN_OUT\n\tlist : CONS_REG;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_INPUT\n\tcell : CONS_REG;\nEND_VAR\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)4ca81d4e-3210-431f-87ae-e32c55f26799_Decl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TypeInfos": {
